This repository bundles modified copies of the following projects. Their licenses and copyright notices are kept
in their directories; changes made for this work are described in each directory's MODIFICATIONS.md.

- openral/                 OpenRAL, Apache-2.0 (OpenRAL Contributors). Upstream: https://github.com/OpenRAL/openral
                           Based on commit 93385213 of the DsslRobot fork.
- space_robotics_bench/    Space Robotics Bench, Apache-2.0 OR MIT (Andrej Orsula). Upstream:
                           https://github.com/AndrejOrsula/space_robotics_bench
                           Based on commit 94696f61 of the DsslRobot fork. Includes lunar-base scene tooling.

Simulation assets (not in git; see README) are built from third-party models. Each keeps its own license; the full
list with authors and sources is space_robotics_bench/assets/lunar_base/ATTRIBUTION.md. Several are CC-BY-4.0 and one
is CC-BY-SA-4.0, so the asset archive must be redistributed with that attribution file.

External planners used by the baselines are not bundled and keep their own licenses: NASA PLEXIL and NASA EUROPA
(see baselines/europa and baselines/plexil for build scripts and patches).
